; Synthetic fixture for cavern-compatible *date parsing: one inner block
; per *date form cavern reads (plans/SURVEX_DATE_PARSING_PLAN.md section 1).
; The outer block's unpadded date is the entry file's first valid date,
; and the included child dates its block through the block walk alone.
*begin dateforms
*date 2003.2.1
*fix o1 0 0 0
*data normal from to tape compass clino
o1 o2 1.0 0 0
o2 dotted-unpadded.s1 1.0 0 0
o2 dotted-padded.s1 1.0 0 0
o2 iso-unpadded.s1 1.0 0 0
o2 year.s1 1.0 0 0
o2 dotted-month.s1 1.0 0 0
o2 iso-month.s1 1.0 0 0
o2 dotted-range.s1 1.0 0 0
o2 iso-space-range.s1 1.0 0 0
o2 year-range.s1 1.0 0 0
o2 surveyed.s1 1.0 0 0
o2 explored.s1 1.0 0 0
o2 two-digit-year.s1 1.0 0 0
o2 included.s1 1.0 0 0

*begin dotted-unpadded
*date 2005.11.5
s1 s2 1.0 0 0
*end dotted-unpadded

*begin dotted-padded
*date 2005.11.05
s1 s2 1.0 0 0
*end dotted-padded

*begin iso-unpadded
*date 2005-11-5
s1 s2 1.0 0 0
*end iso-unpadded

*begin year
*date 2005
s1 s2 1.0 0 0
*end year

*begin dotted-month
*date 2005.11
s1 s2 1.0 0 0
*end dotted-month

*begin iso-month
*date 2005-11
s1 s2 1.0 0 0
*end iso-month

*begin dotted-range
*date 2004.01.05-2004.01.07
s1 s2 1.0 0 0
*end dotted-range

*begin iso-space-range
*date 2004-01-05 2004-01-07
s1 s2 1.0 0 0
*end iso-space-range

*begin year-range
*date 1973-1975
s1 s2 1.0 0 0
*end year-range

*begin surveyed
*date surveyed 2005-11-05
s1 s2 1.0 0 0
*end surveyed

*begin explored
*date explored 2005-11-05
s1 s2 1.0 0 0
*end explored

*begin two-digit-year
*date 99.1.5
s1 s2 1.0 0 0
*end two-digit-year

*include survex_date_forms_child.svx
*end dateforms
